# Production Environment (Vercel)
#
# All data is fetched through our own backend at /api, which proxies Yahoo
# Finance and IndianAPI server-side. The IndianAPI key lives ONLY in the
# Vercel project env as INDIAN_API_KEY (no VITE_ prefix), so it is never
# shipped to the browser.
#
# Do NOT put any secret in this file: every VITE_* var is inlined into the
# public JS bundle at build time.
VITE_API_URL=/api
